get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/plan/default_user
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Meal Plan Endpoint
  
  Fetches the active meal plan and portions for the specified user.
  
  ### Lookup Formats
  This endpoint accepts:
  1. A UUID (e.g. `user_id` from user_profiles)
  2. A username/default identifier (e.g. `default_user`)
  3. A user's email address (e.g. `user@example.com` - looks up the UUID dynamically)
  
  ### Fallback
  If the specified user does not have a cached plan, the API will try to fallback to the `default_user` plan.
}
